  "description": "Rich, hot beer cheese soup may not sound like ideal summer fare, but this version is made with a warm-weather cookout star—smoky grilled brats—that transform it into a dish that's seasonally appropriate. Flavored with cheddar and spiked with a bit of Velveeta for improved texture, it's my go-to meal when I want a taste of my Midwestern roots.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: homemade chicken stock → store-bought low-sodium chicken broth",
